# Format:
#   elan  <elan-init-url>  sha256=<hex>  [commit=<git-sha>]
#
# Bump procedure: update URL commit segment + sha256 together (content-pin pair).
#
# THE PIN IS MANDATORY, and it is one of three things (081M25Z29W4087G0R002Y0Q1MG):
#   sha256=<64-hex>                     verified before use.
#   sha256=tag-only  tagonly=<reason>   the URL carries a version-shaped tag; we pin the tag.
#   sha256=unpinned  unpinned=<reason>  no version to pin at all. Refused when a tag exists.
# The reason is a VALUE, never a comment — a comment is copied along with the line it excuses.
